{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0luZGlhbl9CYW5nbGEvMjAyMC0tQmVmb3JlL1JhYWdpbmklMjAlMjgyMDE3JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Raagini","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/sjtSn4cCvBl8iEdtxCpSubFsZdO.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b8tAEsTMi5Vr7bDJyA7lsY0mnPh.jpg","description":"It’s the story of a mother & daughter. Their journey, struggle and the mother’s dream to make her daughter a renowned singer. Due to various family constraints, the mother could not become a successful singer and now she wants her daughter to become one to fulfill her long cherished desire.  Raagini, the daughter, at a tender age of 8, won the best singer award at the junior Sangeet Samman, a prestigious music reality show. But, soon after she got separated from her mother.  Years later while performing in a huge show, she sings her favourite song which her mother once taught her, in an effort to find her long lost mother. Ragini fulfills her mothers wishes but will she fulfill her own wish to be reunited with her mother? Will her voice be able to reach her mother at last?\n\nReleased 26 Sept 2018 · India · Language: Bengali\n\nOn your server — Audio: Bengali","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Drama","Romance","Bengali"],"moviedb_id":553305,"tmdbId":553305,"cast":["Anjana Basu","Ujani Dasgupta","Somraj Maity","Bhaswar Chatterjee","Krishna Kishore Mukhopadhyay"],"director":["Anindya Sarkar"],"writer":["Joydeep Mukherjee"],"released":"2018-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Raagini (2017)","country":"India","language":"Bengali","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Anindya Sarkar","character":"Director"},{"name":"Anjana Basu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aV3g6UCfvkdjCo3bFLJQXvZAgiN.jpg"},{"name":"Ujani Dasgupta"},{"name":"Somraj Maity","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7GTBp4iW1b3bhiQ18xrPASfEP7I.jpg"},{"name":"Bhaswar Chatterjee","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/agkI0zcFAiknsHJJHTvOckbLqQ1.jpg"},{"name":"Krishna Kishore Mukh